  "question": "Business requirements for a retail supermarket promotion management system: A retailer manages multiple stores and needs to record their store numbers, store names, and store addresses. The retailer also sells a variety of products, each of which has a product number, product name, product model, product barcode, and product price. A retail supermarket needs to manage its promotional activities, including activity numbers, activity names, activity times, participating store numbers, promotional product numbers, and discounts. A promotional activity may include multiple stores and multiple products. After each promotion, the promotion effect needs to be recorded, including sales, sales volume, and the number of participating members. The system also needs to evaluate the effectiveness of promotional activities, and the evaluation indicators include sales growth rate and customer participation.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0203\nCREATE TABLE `store` (\n  `store_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `store_number` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `store_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `store_address` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`store_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_store_number` (`store_number`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `product` (\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `product_number` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `product_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `product_model` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `product_barcode` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `product_price` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`product_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_product_number` (`product_number`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_product_barcode` (`product_barcode`) \n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `promotion_activity` (\n  `activity_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `activity_number` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `activity_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `activity_start_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `activity_end_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`activity_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_activity_number` (`activity_number`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `promotion_activity_store` (\n  `activity_store_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `activity_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `store_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`activity_store_id`),\n  KEY `idx_pas_activity_id` (`activity_id`),\n  KEY `idx_pas_store_id` (`store_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `promotion_activity_store_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`activity_id`) REFERENCES `promotion_activity` (`activity_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `promotion_activity_store_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`store_id`) REFERENCES `store` (`store_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `promotion_activity_product` (\n  `activity_product_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `activity_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `discount` decimal(5,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`activity_product_id`),\n  KEY `idx_pap_activity_id` (`activity_id`),\n  KEY `idx_pap_product_id` (`product_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `promotion_activity_product_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`activity_id`) REFERENCES `promotion_activity` (`activity_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `promotion_activity_product_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`product_id`) REFERENCES `product` (`product_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `promotion_effect` (\n  `effect_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `activity_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `sales` decimal(12,2) NOT NULL,\n  `sales_volume` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `participating_members` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`effect_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_effect_activity_id` (`activity_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `promotion_effect_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`activity_id`) REFERENCES `promotion_activity` (`activity_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `promotion_evaluation` (\n  `evaluation_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `activity_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `sales_growth_rate` decimal(8,4) NOT NULL,\n  `customer_participation` decimal(8,4) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`evaluation_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_evaluation_activity_id` (`activity_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `promotion_evaluation_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`activity_id`) REFERENCES `promotion_activity` (`activity_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
